{{also|svår|svär}}
==Indian==
The origin of this word is believed to be from [Sanskrit[http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sanskrit]]  language. Later it has been derived to other Indian languages still the meaning remains the same. Svar means Melodious Tone, earlier it was used for musical notes only later it is used for colloquial usage as well. Other than melodious tone some people make their own meaning out of abbreviations.

